      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَكْذَبُ مِنْ سُهَيْلَةَ</span></b>  is a prov., (O, K,) said to
mean [<i>More lying than</i>] <i>the wind:</i> (O:) or
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سهيلة</span> was a certain liar. (K.)

